<view class="page"><view class="title">绑定邮箱账号</view><view class="subtitle">绑定后，可在网页使用此邮箱登录同一账号。邮箱已有账号时，会合并业务记录；数据冲突时将提示整理，不会覆盖。</view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="note">{{notice}}</view><view class="label">邮箱地址</view><input class="input" value="{{email}}" data-field="email" bindinput="input" placeholder="you@example.com"/><view class="label">验证码</view><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="6" value="{{code}}" data-field="code" bindinput="input" placeholder="6 位验证码"/><button class="button secondary" bindtap="send" disabled="{{busy || cooldown > 0}}">{{cooldown ? cooldown+' 秒后重发':'获取验证码'}}</button><button class="button" bindtap="bind" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !challengeId || code.length !== 6}}">验证并绑定</button></view></view>
